--------------Crzy Slack bot------------
The bot is live 24/7 and works on all channels. It can respond to commands. To interact with the bot, simply type a command in any channel where the bot is present.
The following commands are available for now:
1./crzyslack-ping (Provides the status of the bot)
2./crzyslack-joke (Tells you a joke)
3./crzyslack-help (Lists you all the commands)
4./crzyslack-catfact (Gives you a cat fact)